# Kept out of every image build context.
#
# The Dockerfiles build from the repository root (some of them use `COPY . .`),
# and without this file each build ships the whole working tree first — which
# includes ~37 MB of Docker image tarballs under images/, ~9 MB of screenshots
# at the root, the .git directory and IDE metadata. None of it is needed to
# compile any of the services.

.git
.idea/
images/
*.jpg
*.tar

# Nothing below this line is produced by this repository, but they are cheap
# to exclude in case a build ever runs from a polluted tree.
**/node_modules
**/.DS_Store
